    "name": "Databases collection",
    "definition": "The injectable singleton (`SqlDatabases`, `PgDatabases`; base `DatabasesBase`) that holds every configured non-sharded database, keyed by its `DatabaseKey`. Lookup requires an exact match on casing, accents and kana. Each entry exposes a read/write connection pair. Its membership is fixed when it is built from configuration.",
